WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.120 --> 00:00:04.069
-In the wake of Georgia's
draconian Voter Suppression Law

00:00:04.069 --> 00:00:06.539
and as coronavirus cases
continue to climb back up,

00:00:06.539 --> 00:00:08.308
Republicans are trying
to cancel everyone

00:00:08.308 --> 00:00:10.376
from Major League Baseball
to Dr. Anthony Fauci.

00:00:10.376 --> 00:00:13.546
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:13.546 --> 00:00:17.317
♪♪

00:00:17.317 --> 00:00:20.886
The modern GOP is intellectually
bankrupt and bereft of ideas.

00:00:20.886 --> 00:00:22.421
They don't have
popular policies,

00:00:22.421 --> 00:00:23.990
and that's why they
lost the presidency

00:00:23.990 --> 00:00:25.358
and both Houses of Congress

00:00:25.358 --> 00:00:27.059
and spend all their time whining

00:00:27.059 --> 00:00:28.394
about the dumbest [bleep]
on Earth,

00:00:28.394 --> 00:00:30.797
like Dr. Seuss
or Mr. Potato Head.

00:00:30.797 --> 00:00:33.933
Although, they're probably
just mad at Mr. Potato Head

00:00:33.933 --> 00:00:36.202
because his face is more
life-like than theirs.

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:39.705
Are you seriously telling me
Rudy wouldn't look more normal

00:00:39.705 --> 00:00:42.074
with Mr. Potato Head's
facial features?

00:00:42.074 --> 00:00:44.911
Now, that's a lawyer
fit for a President.

00:00:44.911 --> 00:00:46.979
"Why you smiling, Rudy?
We got indicted."

00:00:46.979 --> 00:00:49.382
"Oh, sorry, Boss.
Wrong mouth."

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:53.385
[ Laughing ] It's a movement --

00:00:53.385 --> 00:00:56.055
It's a movement built entirely
on racism,

00:00:56.055 --> 00:00:58.458
paranoia,
and fake cultural outrage.

00:00:58.458 --> 00:01:02.094
Just take these actual chyrons
from real Fox News segments

00:01:02.094 --> 00:01:03.463
over the last few weeks --

00:01:03.463 --> 00:01:06.065
"comic book series
snubs Melania Trump"

00:01:06.065 --> 00:01:08.668
and "cancel culture
targeting trees."

00:01:08.668 --> 00:01:10.937
How did a comic book series
snub Melania Trump?

00:01:10.937 --> 00:01:13.839
Did the X-Men not cast her
as the new Emma Frost?

00:01:13.839 --> 00:01:16.809
Because she would make
an insanely good Emma Frost.

00:01:16.809 --> 00:01:18.211
[Bleep]
She did get snubbed.

00:01:18.211 --> 00:01:19.946
Also, I can't believe
they actually found a way

00:01:19.946 --> 00:01:21.681
to get outraged about trees.

00:01:21.681 --> 00:01:22.849
You can't win with these people.

00:01:22.849 --> 00:01:24.617
They used to accuse the left
of hugging trees.

00:01:24.617 --> 00:01:26.552
Now they accuse the left
of canceling trees.

00:01:26.552 --> 00:01:29.021
You know who actually
tried to cancel trees?

00:01:29.021 --> 00:01:31.757
The Once-Ler, a character
created by Dr. Seuss,

00:01:31.757 --> 00:01:34.293
who Fox News claims
has also been canceled.

00:01:34.293 --> 00:01:36.295
But wait a second.
Books are made from trees.

00:01:36.295 --> 00:01:38.230
So by Fox logic,
does that mean Dr. Seuss

00:01:38.230 --> 00:01:39.665
tried to cancel trees

00:01:39.665 --> 00:01:41.534
by writing books
about saving trees?

00:01:41.534 --> 00:01:43.068
If you pose that question
to Brian Kilmeade,

00:01:43.068 --> 00:01:45.705
he will short-circuit like
an android in a sci-fi movie.

00:01:45.705 --> 00:01:47.573
Though, honestly,
you'd get the same result

00:01:47.573 --> 00:01:49.675
from a Denny's place-mat maze.

00:01:49.675 --> 00:01:51.544
"He's supposed to get
all the way over there

00:01:51.544 --> 00:01:53.679
from all the way over here?"

00:01:53.679 --> 00:01:57.015
Republicans have taken their
supposed cancel culture
obsession so far,

00:01:57.015 --> 00:01:59.585
they're actually proposing
real legislation about it.

00:01:59.585 --> 00:02:01.854
They want to use
the power of the state

00:02:01.854 --> 00:02:04.123
to cancel speech or activism
they don't like.

00:02:04.123 --> 00:02:05.491
For example, yesterday,

00:02:05.491 --> 00:02:08.361
Senators Ted Cruz, Josh Hawley,
and Mike Lee

00:02:08.361 --> 00:02:11.331
introduced legislation to punish
Major League Baseball

00:02:11.331 --> 00:02:14.067
by stripping it
of its antitrust exemption

00:02:14.067 --> 00:02:16.869
after the MLB moved
its All-Star Game in protest

00:02:16.869 --> 00:02:19.438
of Georgia's egregious
new Voter Suppression Law.

00:02:19.438 --> 00:02:21.006
And again, let's just remember

00:02:21.006 --> 00:02:22.675
that the Georgia law
is so extreme

00:02:22.675 --> 00:02:24.744
that it actually
makes it a crime

00:02:24.744 --> 00:02:27.846
to offer food or water
to voters waiting in lines.

00:02:27.846 --> 00:02:30.049
Even Lindsey Graham,
who supports the law

00:02:30.049 --> 00:02:32.385
and has spread the big lie
about nonexistent voter fraud

00:02:32.385 --> 00:02:35.054
that motivated the Georgia bill,
could not defend that.

00:02:35.054 --> 00:02:37.423
-Senator, why on Earth,

00:02:37.423 --> 00:02:41.193
if Americans are willing
to wait hours to vote,

00:02:41.193 --> 00:02:43.496
would you make it a crime
for people to come

00:02:43.496 --> 00:02:45.965
and give them a bottle of water?

00:02:45.965 --> 00:02:49.102
-Well, we --
All I can say is that

00:02:49.102 --> 00:02:50.904
that doesn't make
a whole lot of sense to me.

00:02:50.904 --> 00:02:52.505
-Even Lindsey Graham
was speechless,

00:02:52.505 --> 00:02:54.274
a man who has,
on multiple occasions,

00:02:54.274 --> 00:02:56.242
given lengthy speeches
on the Senate floor

00:02:56.242 --> 00:02:58.510
like an actor doing
a David Mamet monologue

00:02:58.510 --> 00:03:00.746
in an audition for
the local community theater.

00:03:00.746 --> 00:03:03.749
"As you all know, first prize
is a Cadillac Eldorado.

00:03:03.749 --> 00:03:05.184
Anyone want to see
the second prize?

00:03:05.184 --> 00:03:07.186
Second prize
is a set of steak knives.

00:03:07.186 --> 00:03:09.321
Third prize is you have to
live with my meemaw

00:03:09.321 --> 00:03:10.523
and wash her feet

00:03:10.523 --> 00:03:12.558
so I can finally leave
this one-horse town

00:03:12.558 --> 00:03:14.026
and make something of myself.

00:03:14.026 --> 00:03:17.095
I'll teach them how to wash them
how you like, Meemaw!

00:03:17.095 --> 00:03:21.334
Geez and also Louise!"

00:03:21.334 --> 00:03:23.536
That's how indefensible
the Georgia law is.

00:03:23.536 --> 00:03:26.038
And yet Republicans want to use
the power of the state

00:03:26.038 --> 00:03:27.907
to silence anyone
who opposes it,

00:03:27.907 --> 00:03:29.642
and they're doing it
under the guise

00:03:29.642 --> 00:03:32.612
of supposedly opposing
monopolies and corporate power.

00:03:32.612 --> 00:03:34.814
-Three Republican senators
are looking to put pressure

00:03:34.814 --> 00:03:36.282
on Major League Baseball

00:03:36.282 --> 00:03:38.885
after it decided to pull the
All-Star Game out of Georgia,

00:03:38.885 --> 00:03:40.653
the League making the move
to protest

00:03:40.653 --> 00:03:42.655
Georgia's controversial
new voting law.

00:03:42.655 --> 00:03:45.024
Senators Ted Cruz, Mike Lee,
and Josh Hawley

00:03:45.024 --> 00:03:46.859
are introducing legislation
today

00:03:46.859 --> 00:03:50.195
to eliminate a nearly
century-old antitrust exemption

00:03:50.195 --> 00:03:51.530
from Major League Baseball

00:03:51.530 --> 00:03:53.299
as a way
of punishing the League.

00:03:53.299 --> 00:03:56.168
-On the Republican side,
you're really seeing eyes opened

00:03:56.168 --> 00:03:58.671
to the power and danger
of these monopolies.

00:03:58.671 --> 00:04:00.940
I think voters already know it.
I mean, they're living it.

00:04:00.940 --> 00:04:03.175
They're being censored
on social media.

00:04:03.175 --> 00:04:04.711
They're living in fear

00:04:04.711 --> 00:04:07.146
that these banks are
going to cancel them,

00:04:07.146 --> 00:04:09.214
that these big corporations
are going to cancel them.

00:04:09.214 --> 00:04:11.417
-I'm sorry, you think voters
are living in fear

00:04:11.417 --> 00:04:14.119
that Coca-Cola
or United Airlines
are going to cancel them?

00:04:14.119 --> 00:04:16.855
And what do you mean they're
afraid banks are going to
cancel them, too?

00:04:16.855 --> 00:04:19.725
I mean, the closest I've ever
come to having a bank cancel me

00:04:19.725 --> 00:04:21.928
was when I got dragged away
from a Coinstar machine

00:04:21.928 --> 00:04:25.064
because it got jammed up
on some Pogs and Canadian coins.

00:04:25.064 --> 00:04:26.933
"I'm sorry not everything
in my big-ass jar

00:04:26.933 --> 00:04:29.135
isn't a U.S. coin with
some dead white guy on it.

00:04:29.135 --> 00:04:31.437
I'm sorry you don't have room in
your coin-counting metal mouth

00:04:31.437 --> 00:04:33.673
for my Domino's Pizza Noid Pog."

00:04:33.673 --> 00:04:35.608
Also, yeah, sure,
Republicans are totally

00:04:35.608 --> 00:04:37.877
having their eyes opened
to dangerous corporations

00:04:37.877 --> 00:04:39.812
after they shoveled $2 trillion
in tax cuts

00:04:39.812 --> 00:04:42.281
into the pockets of corporations
like Amazon,

00:04:42.281 --> 00:04:45.985
which, by the way, paid zero
in federal income taxes in 2018,

00:04:45.985 --> 00:04:48.754
thanks in part
to the GOP tax cut,

00:04:48.754 --> 00:04:51.490
not to mention all the other
regulatory rollbacks

00:04:51.490 --> 00:04:53.392
and tax breaks
and other giveaways

00:04:53.392 --> 00:04:55.694
Republicans have thrown at large
corporations over the years.

00:04:55.694 --> 00:04:57.730
Republicans punish corporations

00:04:57.730 --> 00:05:00.199
the way clueless dads
punish their kids.

00:05:00.199 --> 00:05:02.268
"Oh, you're smoking
Dad's cigarette?

00:05:02.268 --> 00:05:04.303
Well, maybe you'd also
like a glass of scotch

00:05:04.303 --> 00:05:05.437
and a nice steak, too.

00:05:05.437 --> 00:05:07.306
You would?
And how do you like it cooked?

00:05:07.306 --> 00:05:09.375
Hold on, I'm gonna write this
down so I don't get it wrong.

00:05:09.375 --> 00:05:10.576
Pink in the middle.

00:05:10.576 --> 00:05:12.545
Okay, I'll have that for you
in one minute.

00:05:12.545 --> 00:05:15.682
Can I get you some bread while
you wait and learn your lesson?"

00:05:15.682 --> 00:05:17.549
The way you know
this is all bull[bleep]

00:05:17.549 --> 00:05:19.852
is that progressives like Bernie
Sanders and Elizabeth Warren

00:05:19.852 --> 00:05:22.054
have actually taken on
big corporations

00:05:22.054 --> 00:05:25.091
by, among other things,
using the Consumer Financial
Protection Bureau

00:05:25.091 --> 00:05:27.126
to fight predatory
corporate practices

00:05:27.126 --> 00:05:29.895
or by proposing
real detailed plans

00:05:29.895 --> 00:05:31.864
to break up big tech companies.

00:05:31.864 --> 00:05:33.566
They've already been doing
that stuff for years,

00:05:33.566 --> 00:05:35.901
and they were met with either
silence or hostility

00:05:35.901 --> 00:05:37.503
by fake populists in the GOP.

00:05:37.503 --> 00:05:39.638
In fact, Bernie even
went down to Alabama

00:05:39.638 --> 00:05:41.774
to support the Amazon union
drive there.

00:05:41.774 --> 00:05:42.909
Where was supposed

00:05:42.909 --> 00:05:44.944
anti-corporate crusader
Josh Hawley?

00:05:44.944 --> 00:05:47.513
Probably peeling off
his morning face mask

00:05:47.513 --> 00:05:49.548
while listening to
Huey Lewis and the News.

00:05:49.548 --> 00:05:51.883
And, by the way, these same
Republicans who pretend
to be pro-worker

00:05:51.883 --> 00:05:54.687
also pretended to be anti-war
during the Trump years

00:05:54.687 --> 00:05:57.122
when they suddenly started
decrying endless wars,

00:05:57.122 --> 00:05:59.625
even as Trump was showing off
giant posters

00:05:59.625 --> 00:06:02.027
of all the weapons
he was selling to Saudi Arabia

00:06:02.027 --> 00:06:03.796
in the Oval Office
like an eighth grader

00:06:03.796 --> 00:06:06.098
who threw together
a history class project

00:06:06.098 --> 00:06:07.399
at the last minute.

00:06:07.399 --> 00:06:08.768
"So as you can see,
during World War II,

00:06:08.768 --> 00:06:10.669
they used boats,
but they also used planes.

00:06:10.669 --> 00:06:13.539
And interestingly,
they also used spaceships,

00:06:13.539 --> 00:06:14.807
little space men."

00:06:14.807 --> 00:06:17.309
So given that Republicans
pretended to suddenly care

00:06:17.309 --> 00:06:19.846
about ending endless wars
during the Trump years,

00:06:19.846 --> 00:06:21.547
you'd think they would have
been thrilled

00:06:21.547 --> 00:06:23.182
when President Biden
announced that the U.S.

00:06:23.182 --> 00:06:26.819
would finally withdraw troops
from Afghanistan by September,

00:06:26.819 --> 00:06:28.955
20 years after the war began.

00:06:28.955 --> 00:06:31.924
And it is insane that this
has not happened yet.

00:06:31.924 --> 00:06:34.093
The war in Afghanistan should
have ended a long time ago.

00:06:34.093 --> 00:06:37.229
Last time we were in a war this
long, it starred Alan Alda.

00:06:37.229 --> 00:06:39.465
That's a joke for
the TikTok crowd.

00:06:39.465 --> 00:06:41.166
Anyway, this will not shock you.

00:06:41.166 --> 00:06:43.068
The same Republicans
who cheered on Trump

00:06:43.068 --> 00:06:45.538
are now opposed
to ending endless wars.

00:06:45.538 --> 00:06:48.640
-Precipitously withdrawing
U.S. forces from Afghanistan

00:06:48.640 --> 00:06:50.976
is a grave mistake.

00:06:50.976 --> 00:06:52.978
It is a retreat
in the face of an enemy

00:06:52.978 --> 00:06:55.448
that has not yet
been vanquished,

00:06:55.448 --> 00:06:58.183
an abdication
of American leadership.

00:06:58.183 --> 00:07:00.152
-Oklahoma Senator James Inhofe,

00:07:00.152 --> 00:07:03.222
the top Republican on the Senate
Armed Services Committee,

00:07:03.222 --> 00:07:05.925
called the President's decision
premature.

00:07:05.925 --> 00:07:07.426
-It's ludicrous.

00:07:07.426 --> 00:07:10.295
-It's an action South Carolina
Senator Lindsey Graham

00:07:10.295 --> 00:07:11.530
disapproves of.

00:07:11.530 --> 00:07:13.565
In a statement,
the Republican said, quote,

00:07:13.565 --> 00:07:15.968
"If reports are accurate
that President Biden

00:07:15.968 --> 00:07:19.138
is withdrawing all forces
from Afghanistan,

00:07:19.138 --> 00:07:20.806
it's a disaster in the making.

00:07:20.806 --> 00:07:22.808
A full withdrawal
from Afghanistan

00:07:22.808 --> 00:07:24.710
is so irresponsible."

00:07:24.710 --> 00:07:28.347
Graham referred to the action
as, quote, "dumber than dirt."

00:07:28.347 --> 00:07:29.681
-Seriously,
what do these guys want?

00:07:29.681 --> 00:07:31.750
A permanent military presence
in Afghanistan?

00:07:31.750 --> 00:07:32.919
It's been 20 years.

00:07:32.919 --> 00:07:35.588
Nothing that goes on
for that long stays good,

00:07:35.588 --> 00:07:37.957
with the exception of
"Law &amp; Order: SVU,"

00:07:37.957 --> 00:07:40.726
which, if Biden keeps his word,
will run longer

00:07:40.726 --> 00:07:42.461
than the U.S. war
in Afghanistan.

00:07:42.461 --> 00:07:45.364
Congratulations to you all,
but bad news -- you've been
reassigned.

00:07:45.364 --> 00:07:48.000
So sometimes Republicans pretend
to be anti-corporations,

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:50.069
then they oppose raising taxes
on corporations.

00:07:50.069 --> 00:07:52.137
Sometimes they pretend
to be anti-war,

00:07:52.137 --> 00:07:53.906
then they oppose ending wars.

00:07:53.906 --> 00:07:55.875
What all of this shows is
that the Republican party

00:07:55.875 --> 00:07:58.377
has no actual
ideological principles,

00:07:58.377 --> 00:08:00.646
no core beliefs
other than racism, paranoia,

00:08:00.646 --> 00:08:03.783
and feigned cultural outrage
against anything they perceive

00:08:03.783 --> 00:08:05.651
as even a mild infringement

00:08:05.651 --> 00:08:07.386
on their right to do
whatever the hell they want.

00:08:07.386 --> 00:08:10.255
For example, even as
COVID cases climb back up

00:08:10.255 --> 00:08:11.723
and public health officials
worry

00:08:11.723 --> 00:08:13.759
about one last surge
before summer,

00:08:13.759 --> 00:08:16.028
they're still spreading
dangerous misinformation

00:08:16.028 --> 00:08:18.964
about lockdown,
social distancing, and masks.

00:08:18.964 --> 00:08:22.901
And, yes, vaccine distribution
has been a huge success so far.

00:08:22.901 --> 00:08:24.670
Just a few days ago,
we hit a new record

00:08:24.670 --> 00:08:26.872
at 4.6 million vaccinations
in one day,

00:08:26.872 --> 00:08:28.740
and officials have pledged

00:08:28.740 --> 00:08:31.043
that the Johnson &amp; Johnson pause
won't slow things down.

00:08:31.043 --> 00:08:33.045
In fact, Pfizer just announced
they'll be able to produce

00:08:33.045 --> 00:08:35.448
10% more of it's highly safe
and effective vaccine

00:08:35.448 --> 00:08:36.749
by the end of May.

00:08:36.749 --> 00:08:39.618
And, yes, real-world studies
of vaccinated groups,

00:08:39.618 --> 00:08:42.521
from the Mayo Clinic to the CDC,
to front-line healthcare workers

00:08:42.521 --> 00:08:44.490
to nursing-home staff,
have shown the vaccines

00:08:44.490 --> 00:08:46.158
to be incredibly effective.

00:08:46.158 --> 00:08:47.827
But while cases are still high,

00:08:47.827 --> 00:08:49.294
we should all continue
to remain cautious.

00:08:49.294 --> 00:08:50.696
It's just
the decent thing to do.

00:08:50.696 --> 00:08:52.398
I mean, I still wear my mask

00:08:52.398 --> 00:08:54.233
and keep my distance
until cases are down,

00:08:54.233 --> 00:08:56.168
and everyone around me
is vaccinated,

00:08:56.168 --> 00:08:58.037
even though I already
got my second shot,

00:08:58.037 --> 00:08:59.605
which I was thrilled about,

00:08:59.605 --> 00:09:01.440
even though it felt like
Hugh Jackman

00:09:01.440 --> 00:09:04.176
had punched me in the deltoid,
which actually happened.

00:09:04.176 --> 00:09:07.712
That was so long ago,
we were still in Afghanistan.

00:09:07.712 --> 00:09:10.282
One of the GOP's most aggressive
purveyors of COVID lies

00:09:10.282 --> 00:09:11.984
and staunchest
anti-mask crusaders

00:09:11.984 --> 00:09:13.219
has been Rand Paul,

00:09:13.219 --> 00:09:14.620
and this week,
he actually suggested

00:09:14.620 --> 00:09:16.789
that Dr. Anthony Fauci
should be taken off TV

00:09:16.789 --> 00:09:18.957
for continuing
to suggest caution

00:09:18.957 --> 00:09:20.693
as cases continue to rise.

00:09:20.693 --> 00:09:23.529
-There is no scientific evidence
that the lockdowns in Michigan

00:09:23.529 --> 00:09:25.965
have done anything
or in California.

00:09:25.965 --> 00:09:29.568
So there is no real correlation
between economic lockdowns,

00:09:29.568 --> 00:09:31.504
mask mandates, or any of this.

00:09:31.504 --> 00:09:34.806
So I think it's actually
television malpractice

00:09:34.806 --> 00:09:37.109
for these TV doctors
to come on and say,

00:09:37.109 --> 00:09:39.478
"Oh, the mask is so much more
important than the vaccine.

00:09:39.478 --> 00:09:41.380
It's so much more of
an immediate benefit."

00:09:41.380 --> 00:09:45.350
Dr. Fauci should be
voluntarily removed from TV,

00:09:45.350 --> 00:09:48.053
because what he says
is such a disservice

00:09:48.053 --> 00:09:49.755
and such fearmongering,

00:09:49.755 --> 00:09:51.723
and almost all of what he says

00:09:51.723 --> 00:09:54.660
isn't even matched by the
science of his own institute.

00:09:54.660 --> 00:09:56.928
-I'm sorry,
you want Fauci off TV?

00:09:56.928 --> 00:09:58.130
If I had to choose between

00:09:58.130 --> 00:10:00.833
the kindly world-renowned
infectious disease expert

00:10:00.833 --> 00:10:02.568
who was played by Brad Pitt
on "SNL"

00:10:02.568 --> 00:10:04.236
or the guy
who looks like a puppet

00:10:04.236 --> 00:10:06.739
fired by the Jim Henson workshop
for stealing office supplies,

00:10:06.739 --> 00:10:08.040
I'd go with Fauci.

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:10.676
Also, does this mean
you're trying to cancel Fauci?

00:10:10.676 --> 00:10:13.145
You guys accuse the left of
trying to cancel Dr. Seuss,

00:10:13.145 --> 00:10:15.747
and now you're trying to cancel
an actual doctor?

00:10:15.747 --> 00:10:17.850
If this keeps up, Republicans
are going to try to cancel

00:10:17.850 --> 00:10:20.019
actual potatoes.

00:10:20.019 --> 00:10:22.655
Also, I like how Rand Paul
wants to cancel Fauci,

00:10:22.655 --> 00:10:25.224
but in order to avoid
using the word "cancel,"

00:10:25.224 --> 00:10:27.059
he calls it voluntary removal.

00:10:27.059 --> 00:10:29.395
That's just canceling
by another name.

00:10:29.395 --> 00:10:32.464
NBC should have tried that. "We
didn't cancel 'Animal Practice.'

00:10:32.464 --> 00:10:35.934
We voluntarily removed it
and burned all the tapes."

00:10:35.934 --> 00:10:37.536
Paul won't stop
going after Fauci.

00:10:37.536 --> 00:10:39.471
He seems determined to keep
spreading misinformation

00:10:39.471 --> 00:10:40.639
about public health measures.

00:10:40.639 --> 00:10:42.207
This week, Paul also tweeted,

00:10:42.207 --> 00:10:44.776
"Fauci continues to ignore
100 years of vaccine science.

00:10:44.776 --> 00:10:46.945
His only real theme is,
'Do what I say,

00:10:46.945 --> 00:10:48.547
even when it makes no sense.'

00:10:48.547 --> 00:10:51.383
If you've recovered
or been vaccinated,
go about your life.

00:10:51.383 --> 00:10:53.118
Eat, drink, work,
open the schools.

00:10:53.118 --> 00:10:54.919
Enough with the petty tyrants!"

00:10:54.919 --> 00:10:56.856
He is a petty tyrant.

00:10:56.856 --> 00:10:58.691
You guys are the ones
trying to cancel baseball.

00:10:58.691 --> 00:11:00.759
You can't get more anti-American
than going after baseball.

00:11:00.759 --> 00:11:02.361
What you going to do?
Take up cricket?

00:11:02.361 --> 00:11:04.229
Which, honestly,
would look less ridiculous

00:11:04.229 --> 00:11:06.164
than what Rand Paul
usually wears.

00:11:06.164 --> 00:11:08.500
Also, how can you say
that wearing masks

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:10.836
and keeping people
physically apart from each other

00:11:10.836 --> 00:11:12.570
doesn't stop the virus
from spreading?

00:11:12.570 --> 00:11:15.473
It's literally based on
the germ theory of disease,

00:11:15.473 --> 00:11:17.976
which is centuries old
and was popularized by,

00:11:17.976 --> 00:11:20.345
among other famous figure,
Louis Pasteur.

00:11:20.345 --> 00:11:21.480
I shouldn't have to
explain this to you.

00:11:21.480 --> 00:11:22.848
I'm just a late-night host.

00:11:22.848 --> 00:11:24.649
I barely paid attention
in high school.

00:11:24.649 --> 00:11:26.018
I was hanging
in the back of math class,

00:11:26.018 --> 00:11:27.853
making all my friends laugh
by doing hilarious stuff,

00:11:27.853 --> 00:11:30.822
like typing "ace of base"
upside down on a calculator.

00:11:30.822 --> 00:11:32.657
And then when the teacher
asked me to go up to the board

00:11:32.657 --> 00:11:35.894
and identify the curve,
I'd write, "I saw the sine."

00:11:35.894 --> 00:11:38.163
Another one
for the TikTok crowd.

00:11:38.163 --> 00:11:40.533
Come up with a dance for that.

00:11:40.533 --> 00:11:42.568
What? You won't?

00:11:42.568 --> 00:11:45.304
Why, too busy?
Oh, you just don't like it?

00:11:45.304 --> 00:11:47.372
Okay.

00:11:47.372 --> 00:11:49.374
Thanks for the feedback.

00:11:49.374 --> 00:11:51.810
Republicans decry
supposed cancel culture,

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:54.146
but that's exactly what
they're engaged in right now.

00:11:54.146 --> 00:11:56.782
They want to use their platforms
and the power of the state

00:11:56.782 --> 00:11:58.517
to cancel anyone
they disagree with,

00:11:58.517 --> 00:12:00.318
from Anthony Fauci to
Major League Baseball.

00:12:00.318 --> 00:12:02.287
Rand Paul is up for reelection
in 2022.

00:12:02.287 --> 00:12:03.988
And if you ask me,
he should be...

00:12:03.988 --> 00:12:05.657
-Voluntarily removed.

00:12:05.657 --> 00:12:07.526
-This has been "A Closer Look."

00:12:07.526 --> 00:12:11.063
♪♪

00:12:11.063 --> 00:12:12.565
God's Love We Deliver
cooks and brings

00:12:12.565 --> 00:12:13.865
over 2 million meals a year

00:12:13.865 --> 00:12:16.134
to men, women, and children
living with HIV/AIDS,

00:12:16.134 --> 00:12:17.736
cancer, and other
serious illnesses

00:12:17.736 --> 00:12:19.638
and need your help
now more than ever.

00:12:19.638 --> 00:12:22.908
If you're watching this online,
you can hit the "donate" button.

00:12:22.908 --> 00:12:25.177
Stay safe, wear a mask,
get vaccinated.

00:12:25.177 --> 00:12:26.312
We love you.

